r":"Dave","turn_index":16}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","text":"Calvin: Thanks, Dave! It was an awesome feeling seeing everyone come together to celebrate - super rewarding! Look at this photo showcasing how wonderfully we spent our time!\n[Image caption: a photography of a group of people dancing at a party]\n[S28T3] (dia_id: D28:3)\n\nDave: Wow, great job, Calvin! Congrats! What was it like when everyone was cheering you on?\n[S28T4] (dia_id: D28:4)\n\nCalvin: It was incredible, Dave! The room was buzzing with energy and love. It was a powerful reminder of why I'm doing this.\n[Image caption: a photo of a group of people standing on top of a stage]\n[S28T5] (dia_id: D28:5)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin! Creating something that brings people together and inspires them - that's really awesome!\n[S28T6] (dia_id: D28:6)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! It's an awesome feeling. Creating something that people connect with and brings joy is what I'm all about. Moments like this really motivate me to keep growing!\n[S28T7] (dia_id: D28:7)\n\nDave: Wow, Calvin, imagining how your music affects others must be incredible! Keep up the great work! By the way, I recently started a blog on car mods. It's my way to share my passion with others. Do you have any tips on blogging for me? Just take a look at this beautiful car!\n\n\n[Image caption: a photography of a car website design]\n[S28T8] (dia_id: D28:8)\n\nCalvin: Cool, Dave! It's really fun to share your passion through blogging. Have you had any success stories yet with inspiring others?\n[S28T9] (dia_id: D28:9)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! It's awesome people are checking out my blog and asking me for advice. I recently posted about how I made this car look like a beast, and it was great to hear it inspired others to start their own DIY projects.\n[Image caption: a photography of a blue subarunt parked in a parking lot]\n[S28T10] (dia_id: D28:10)\n\nCalvin: Wow, Dave! Your blog is awesome. Helping others get creative is awesome. Keep up the great work!\n[S28T11] (dia_id: D28:11)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! I appreciate the support. It's fulfilling to share my knowledge and help others unleash their creativity.\n[S28T12] (dia_id: D28:12)\n\nCalvin: Yeah Dave, keep doing what you do! Your blog and car mods are inspiring and a great way to help people find their creativity.\n[S28T13] (dia_id: D28:13)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! It means a lot that you enjoy my blog. This car mod was a lot of work, but I think it was worth it in the end.\n[Image caption: a photography of a blue subarunt parked in a parking lot]\n[S28T14] (dia_id: D28:14)\n\nCalvin: Wow Dave, those headlights look great! What did you do to get them looking so good?\n[S28T15] (dia_id: D28:15)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! I spent a lot of time cleaning, polishing, and protecting them - they look great! Just take a look at this photo – these headlights are enchanting!\n\n\n[Image caption: a photography of a blue car parked on a road at night]\n[S28T16] (dia_id: D28:16)","text_sha256":"8fdd3c8491476e37b900c54e105549e9a7fb5cb96bf59a4afadbe42a2d8c8ff2","timestamp":"2023-11-02T17:46:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"08302ae53c7681312a62f5734d6ef73dfd8c86405ba319838bd79230cce094d2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D6:3"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":19,"line_start":18,"source_locators":["[S6T3]"],"text_sha256":"95eba2fcfad39165ac4bbc7cf8774c1bd3587f85ca3f12ee0c4978e9148d345a"},{"dia_ids":["D6:4"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":22,"line_start":21,"source_locators":["[S6T4]"],"text_sha256":"70aa600e6675d4f43095e014abdc137b34c4290049441e0c679c3f2b0c3007a4"},{"dia_ids":["D6:5"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":26,"line_start":24,"source_locators":["[S6T5]"],"text_sha256":"c80278af921493efaff2fce7d460afc2da9edd082c09cf3843fa514fe84f209c"},{"dia_ids":["D6:6"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":29,"line_start":28,"source_locators":["[S6T6]"],"text_sha256":"6821fbc02cf93319aa641977aa1c3